<title>ICELAND: ICELAND SIGNS FINALS ALUMINIUM SMELTER CONTRACTS.</title>
<headline>ICELAND SIGNS FINALS ALUMINIUM SMELTER CONTRACTS.</headline>
<dateline>REYKJAVIK 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Icelandic government said on Thursday it had signed the final agreements with Nordic Aluminum Corp of Iceland, a subsidiary of U.S. Columbia Ventures Corp, on a new 60,000 tonne a year aluminium smelter.</p>
</text>
